# Phase 4: Quality Score ROI Dimension

## Overview

Replace `check_leverage_classification()` (measures IF analysis MENTIONS leverage) with `check_capital_deployment()` (measures IF models ARE capital-deployed assets with ROI calculations). Add new scoring dimension for portfolio construction quality.

## Requirements

- Functional: New `check_capital_deployment()` replaces `check_leverage_classification()` — max 20pts (up from 15)
- Functional: Checks: (1) ROI calculation present per model, (2) deploy_cost specified, (3) sleep test as filter not measurement, (4) portfolio allocation with kill criteria, (5) founder_hours_post_setup specified
- Functional: Keep existing leverage checks as sub-signals within the new dimension
- Functional: Update max score from 175 → 180 (net +5 from dimension upgrade)
- Non-functional: Grade thresholds proportionally adjusted

## Architecture

New dimension replaces `leverage_classification`:

```python
def check_capital_deployment(text: str) -> dict:
    score = 0
    details = []

    # (1) ROI calculation present — 5pts
    roi_patterns = [
        r'ROI[%\s]*[:=]?\s*\d', r'return\s+on\s+invest',
        r'deploy_cost.*→.*passive', r'\$\d+.*→.*\$\d+/mo',
        r'monthly.*ROI', r'payback.*days?',
    ]
    if any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in roi_patterns):
        score += 5
        details.append("ROI calculation present")

    # (2) Deploy cost per model — 5pts
    deploy_patterns = [
        r'deploy[_\s]cost', r'investment[:\s]+\$\d',
        r'capital.*deploy', r'budget.*per.*asset',
        r'\$\d+.*domain|\$\d+.*template|\$\d+.*tool',
    ]
    if any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in deploy_patterns):
        score += 5
        details.append("deployment cost specified")

    # (3) Sleep test as filter (not just measurement) — 4pts
    sleep_filter = [
        r'sleep.*filter|filter.*sleep', r'only.*models.*pass.*sleep',
        r'Q4.*first|first.*Q4', r'sleep.*before.*analysis',
    ]
    # Also accept existing Q4-SLEEP presence
    sleep_present = [r'Q4[_-]?SLEEP', r'sleep\s+test']
    if any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in sleep_filter):
        score += 4
        details.append("sleep test used as filter")
    elif any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in sleep_present):
        score += 2
        details.append("sleep test present (not as filter)")

    # (4) Portfolio/kill criteria — 3pts
    portfolio_patterns = [
        r'portfolio', r'kill.*\d+.*day', r'30.*day.*kill',
        r'reallocat', r'micro.*asset', r'asset.*slot',
    ]
    if any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in portfolio_patterns):
        score += 3
        details.append("portfolio/kill criteria present")

    # (5) Founder hours post-setup — 3pts
    hours_patterns = [
        r'founder.*hour.*post|post.*setup.*hour',
        r'<?\d+h?/week.*after|after.*setup.*\d+h',
        r'max_founder_hours', r'passive.*\d+h',
    ]
    if any(re.search(p, text, re.IGNORECASE) for p in hours_patterns):
        score += 3
        details.append("founder hours post-setup specified")

    # PENALTY: all models are labor without any ROI (same as old penalty)
    is_labor = bool(re.search(
        r'(?:Q5|leverage)[_:\s]+LABOR\b', text, re.IGNORECASE
    )) and not re.search(r'\bHYBRID\b', text)
    has_staircase = bool(re.search(
        r'stair[_-]?step|transition\s+path|labor.*to.*(code|media|saas)',
        text, re.IGNORECASE,
    ))
    if is_labor and not has_staircase:
        score -= 5
        details.append("PENALTY: labor model without staircase")

    return {
        "score": max(score, 0),
        "max": 20,
        "detail": "; ".join(details) or "no capital deployment signals"
    }
```

